<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24153" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in-tĕpesco</span></b> , pŭi,
		3, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>v. inch.
				n.</i>, <i>to become lukewarm.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ne quis intepescat cibus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen.
					Ep. 78</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">strata membris tuis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. H.
				10</span></i>
			. 54: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">intepescit annus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					11, 2, 2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mitigato et intepescente calore,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 1,
					1, 5</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>to become
			weaker</i>, <i>milder; to cool down</i>, <i>lose force</i>, <i>slacken</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">iramque meam prudenti absentia extinxit:
					paululum ergo intepescente saevitia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Petr. 94</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vitium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Amm. 14, 5, 5</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">30, 4, 9</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">alacritas pugnatorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 17, 13, 7</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">of persons,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 20, 10, 1</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
